Package: zestwm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Workspace-first tiling window manager for X11/XLibre
 ZestWM is a small tiling window manager for X11/XLibre built around
 stable workspace identity, a BSP tree, tab groups, special overlays,
 and a file-based configuration (zestwm.conf).
